  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_erato",
      "name": {
        "en": "Erato's Badge",
        "zh": "埃拉托证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_erato",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Erato has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for maintaining distance whilst conducting suppressive fire against enemies of heavy caliber.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Sniper Operator during field operations to exercise Besieger responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员埃拉托擅长保持距离对重型敌人进行火力压制\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为狙击干员，行使攻城手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_erato",
      "name": {
        "en": "Change of Ways",
        "zh": "改弦更张",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_erato",
      "description": {
        "en": "Erato has been in the forest south of the village for a whole month.\nShe sits on a tree branch, idly plucking her bowstring. Not long ago, this was a battlefield where the village's guerrilla forces fought the invaders for control of the land. Sargon's colonial rule over Minos is now merely history, and the small invasion force has left this land that did not belong to them.\n'The brave archer repelled the enemy and became a hero admired far and wide. She also won the national archery championship. Then she returned to her hometown, settling into a life with her farm and garden... No, this ending is too bland. How can a tale of heroic adventure end so simply?'\nThe forest is quiet, and Erato's murmured storytelling is the only sound to be heard. The stiff bowstring vibrates, producing a faintly melodious sound. Several fowlbeasts settle in to form an audience, landing on the branches beside her, as well as her shoulders.\nErato looks south and sighs. The starlight above her head filters through layers of branches, leaving only a faint light. The vast sea of trees blocks the wind blowing in from the distance.\n'They say that the land beyond this forest is an endless desert. The invaders they expelled came from that desert.'\n'Life in places without grass and flowers must be difficult. But why is our world like this? Some places are full of flowers and grass, while others are barren?\n'Maybe the gods were lazy when shaping the lands, and in some places, they sculpted meticulously, creating mountains and lakes full of flowers and grass. In others, they just scribbled, resulting in desert and tundra. Because they live in such different environments, people in different places cannot understand each other, bringing about all manner of conflict... What do you think?'\nOf course, the fowlbeasts do not answer, they only take the flowers from Erato's hairpins and bring them back to their nests.\nErato proceeds with this opening, telling her story while playing and singing. From the hero leaving her hometown to the adventures on the road, meeting like-minded friends and teaching lessons to villains. By the time the story reaches 'The brave archer finally came to the place where the land ends and shot an arrow at the lazy creator god hiding there,' the last fowlbeast had fallen asleep by her side.\nErato jumps down from the tree branch and lands on the soft grass.\n'I should go and see for myself. Maybe I can find a similar story in my travels.'",
        "zh": "埃拉托在村庄南边的森林中已经待了整整一个月。\n她坐在树枝上，百无聊赖地拨弄着自己的弓弦。就在不久前，这里还是村庄自发组织的游击队和入侵者彼此争夺的战场。萨尔贡对米诺斯的殖民统治终究一去不返，这一小支入侵势力很快也离开了这片本不属于自己的土地。\n“英勇的神箭手击退了敌人，变成了人人敬仰的英雄，还在全国的射箭比赛中赢得了冠军。然后她回到故乡，拥有了自己的农场与花园……不不不，这个结局也太平淡了。英雄的冒险故事怎么能无疾而终呢？”\n层林寂静，埃拉托自言自语弹唱的故事就是森林中唯一的声音。硬邦邦的弓弦震动，弹出的声音也隐隐成曲调，几只羽兽作为听众被吸引了过来，落在她身旁枝头，落在她肩头。\n埃拉托望着南边叹了口气，头顶的星光经过层层枝桠的过滤只剩下些微光亮，浩瀚的树海挡住了远方吹来的风。\n“听说在这片森林的更南边，是望不到尽头的沙漠。那些被赶走的入侵者就是从那片沙漠来的。\n“在没有草地与鲜花的地方，人们的生活一定也很辛苦吧。可为什么这片大地会是这副模样？有的地方充满了鲜花芳草，有的地方却只有一片荒芜？\n“或许是神明在塑造这片大地的时候偷了会儿懒，在有些地方精雕细琢，做出了花草纷繁的山峦与碧波荡漾的湖泊，有的地方则是一笔涂抹，所以就有了沙漠和雪原。因为生活的环境天差地别，不同地方的人们才会互不理解，才会有这样那样的纷争……你们怎么看？”\n羽兽当然没有搭话，只是叼走了埃拉托发卡上的花朵带回了自己巢中。\n埃拉托就顺着这个开头讲了下去，边弹边唱。从英雄离开故乡讲到路上发生的奇遇、结识的志同道合的友人还有顺手教训的坏人。当故事讲到“英勇的弓箭手终于来到了大地的尽头，对躲在那里偷懒的造物主射出一箭”时，最后一只羽兽也在她身边睡着了。\n埃拉托从树枝上一跃而下，踩在柔软的草地上，像是一个轻盈的休止符。\n“我应该去外面看看，说不定能在路上找到相似的故事。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
